From 0752ec369c2f73c38d6bfb1c19942c6867879ad7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Barattolo <barattolo@barattolo.store>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:53:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] events: tell the marketplace server about every order
 transition

Re-anchored on v0.20.2 (29 Oct 2026): `hold_invoice_paid` now persists
the transition before notifying and bails silently when the write
fails, so the event moves next to the notifications and only fires for
a stored transition; `check_failure_retries_or_log` gained the
`attempt_started_at` argument (#1065).
